      "message": "[warning] Line 334: 🟡 `setContacts()` no longer updates the trust store state for restored contacts. Previously `updateContact(..., emit\u003dfalse)` still set ALLOWED/BANNED on lifecycle state, but now only callbacks are emitted. On freshly provisioned/restored devices this can leave active/banned peers with stale/undefined certificate permission until a later lifecycle change. Mirror `loadContacts()` behavior here by setting trust status from each normalized stored contact before notifications.",
